# Machine-local notes: installed IMEs, key remappings, monitor layout, app behaviour, host names.
# Individually dull, collectively a profile of someone's work machine — and this repo's origin is
# public. Allowlist, not blocklist: everything is ignored unless named here, so a new note file is
# private by default rather than private only if someone remembered to add a rule.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
